# Scraper HTML cache (data/raw/poe2db_*.html). Used as transient
# input by scripts/update-poe2-*.sh and committed historically, but
# now refreshed every 3h by .github/workflows/refresh-rates.yml —
# keeping these in git would churn ~13 MB/day of timestamp diffs
# with no review value (the canonical output is data/poe2/rates.csv).
# Manually-curated raw data (krakenbul_*.csv, manual/, README.md)
# stays tracked.
data/raw/poe2db_*.html
